---
description: Send shell lines with serial_send_command, not serial_write
alwaysApply: true
---

# Serial shell commands

Use `serial_send_command` for one interactive command at a time. It waits for `boot>` unless `expect_pattern` is set (for example `root>`).

`serial_write` is raw bytes for a binary transfer. Do not put multiple shell lines in it. Do not write the couart agent PTY directly.
